                <pb facs="0951" n="855" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg855"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.51/109: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Salvador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Schuyler</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-11-29T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 29,
                                1921—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>39. Your No. 58, November 23, 3 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department believes that matter referred to is not one upon which official
                    opinion should be expressed. If bank requests names of lawyers in San Salvador
                    there is no objection to your suggesting such names.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
